
  This file contains all parameters which control the TreeCut program
  and define the run conditions.

  Notes:
    1)Comments don't disturb the reading of the parameters by the program.
    2)Parameter may be changed without removing of its previous value. Put *, #
      or something else before "<". For instance, parameter *< Sigma = 56. >
      won't be read in.


